      "data": {
        "title": "Resolve Port Override Before Declaration Default",
        "description": "Add a default-handle relationship to the Declaration. Add a structural handle port to every Port node. Either relationship targets an exposed Handle surface from a Handle definition graph. When rendering an endpoint, resolve the Port handle reference first; otherwise inherit the node Declaration default. Only use the system handle when neither graph-authored reference exists. A derived collector supplies a projected Port-like context and uses the same resolver.",
        "differentiator": "This makes the common appearance cheap to author once while preserving deliberate endpoint-specific handles without copying presentation data or confusing Handle with Glyph.",
        "definitionKey": "idea-proposed-approach",
        "_classBinding": {
          "key": "idea-proposed-approach",
